      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kern_Place"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A 1914 El Paso Herald ad advertised horse trails, planned parks, and homes for sale under $3,500 in the new Kern Place subdivision.",
